---
title: Butter Chicken
tags:
  - entres
source:
  name: Serious Eats
  url: https://www.seriouseats.com/stovetop-butter-chicken
---

= Chicken

Marinade @chicken{2%lbs}(cut into bite-size peices) in @yogurt{0.5%cups}, @lemon juice{1%tbsp}, @ginger-garlic paste{1@tbsp}, @fenugreek leaves{2%tbsp}, @black salt{1%tsp}, @kashmiri chili powder{1%tsp}, @garam masala{1%tsp}, and @salt{1%tbsp} for several hours.

Spread the chicken on a #sheet pan{} and broil for ~{7%min}, or until slightly charred.

= Masala powder

Dry roast @fenugreek leaves{2%tbsp}, @brown cardamon{2%pods}(peeled, just the seeds), and, @cloves{2}.

Let cool then grind.

= Gravy

Melt @ghee{2%tbsp} in a big pot and fry @./cook/bhuna-masala{4%cups}.

Add masala powder and @water{1%cup}, cook for another ~{10%mins}.

> May need additional water

Melt @butter{0.25%cup} in the gravy, then add @heavy cream{0.5%cup}.

Blend with an #immersion blender{} to emulsify slightly.

Add chicken and let it cook together for another ~{10%mins}.